# LIFEOS — THE ADAPTIVE PERSONAL OPERATING SYSTEM
## Full-stack Google AI Studio build specification

You are an expert software architect, senior full-stack engineer, interaction designer, optimization engineer, AI application developer, accessibility specialist, and QA engineer.

Your mission is to design and build **LifeOS**, a premium, AI-assisted personal operating system that turns scattered goals, tasks, routines, and commitments into realistic schedules that adapt when real life changes.

This is a real productivity application intended for everyday use by students, professionals, freelancers, and other individuals managing competing priorities.

It must not be a superficial dashboard, static website, AI-generated mockup, or collection of decorative features.

It must be a fully functional, persistent, secure, responsive web application with a real scheduling engine, working task management, meaningful AI features, and a polished interface.

